# Component reuse

Full spec: `docs/product/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`

**Before creating a new component**, search the repository for existing behavior. **Reuse or extend** — do not create visually similar duplicates.

Build shared primitives once: Button · Input · Select · Modal · Card · EmptyState · etc.

Per-screen one-off buttons/cards → inconsistent “AI app” feel.

When adding a primitive, place it in the **shared** location and consume from all screens.
